            "parts" : [ {
              "id" : "ism-1972_smt",
              "name" : "statement",
              "prose" : "Outsourced cloud service providers and their TOP SECRET cloud services, including sensitive compartmented information cloud services, undergo a security control assessment by ASD assessors (or their delegates), using the latest release of the ISM available prior to the beginning of the security control assessment (or a subsequent release), at least every 24 months."
