          "parts" : [ {
            "name" : "overview",
            "prose" : "Video conferencing and IP telephony infrastructure can be hardened to reduce its attack surface. For example, by ensuring that a Session Initiation Protocol server has a fully patched operating system, uses fully patched applications and only runs required services."
